source_en:
Which of the following pairs of simultaneous equations would have no solutions?
\begin{array}{ccc} 
Pair \( 1 \) & Pair \( 2 \) \\
\( 2 y-2 x=7 \) & & \( 2 x+2 y=7 \) \\
\( 2 x-2 y=7 \) & & \( 2 x-2 y=7 \)
\end{array}

translation:
निम्नलिखित में से किस युग्म के समवर्ती समीकरणों का कोई समाधान नहीं होगा?
\begin{array}{ccc}
जोड़ी \( 1 \) और जोड़ी \( 2 \)\\
\( 2 y-2 x=7 \) & & \( 2 x+2 y=7 \) \\
\( 2 x-2 y=7 \) & & \( 2 x-2 y=7 \)
\end{array}

back_translation:
Which of the following pairs of concurrent equations will have no solution?
\begin{array}{ccc}
Pair \( 1 \) and Pair \( 2 \)\\\
\( 2 y-2 x=7 \) & & \( 2 x+2 y=7 \) \\
\( 2 x-2 y=7 \) & & \( 2 x-2 y=7 \)
\end{array}

