source_en:
In which of the following inequalities could \( \boldsymbol{d}=\mathbf{5} \) ? \begin{tabular}{ll}
Inequality \( 1 \) & Inequality 2 \\
\( 2 d>11 \) & \( 11>d+2 \)
\end{tabular}

translation:
निम्नलिखित में से किस असमानता में \( \boldsymbol{d}=\mathbf{5} \) हो सकती है? \begin{tabular}{ll}
असमानता \( 1 \) और असमानता 2 \
\( 2 d>11 \) & \( 11>d+2 \)
\end{tabular}

back_translation:
Which of the following inequalities can have \( \boldsymbol{d}=\mathbf{5} \)? \begin{tabular}{ll}
Inequality \( 1 \) and Inequality 2\
\( 2 d>11 \) & \( 11>d+2 \)
\end{tabular}

source_en:
What do you need to do to eliminate the \( q \)s in each of these pairs of simultaneous equations?
\begin{array}{cc}
  Pair 1 & Pair 2 \\
\( 2p-4q=6 \) & \( 2p-4q=6 \)\\
\( 7p+4q=9 \) & \( 7p-4q=9 \)
\end{array}

translation:
समवर्ती समीकरणों के इन प्रत्येक जोड़े में \( q \) s को समाप्त करने के लिए आपको क्या करने की आवश्यकता है?
\begin{array}{cc}
जोड़ी 1 और जोड़ी 2 \
\( 2p-4q=6 \) & \( 2p-4q=6 \)\\
\( 7p+4q=9 \) & \( 7p-4q=9 \)
\end{array}

back_translation:
What do you need to do to eliminate \( q \) s in each of these pairs of concurrent equations?
\begin{array}{cc}
Pair 1 and Pair 2\
\( 2p-4q=6 \) & \( 2p-4q=6 \)\\
\( 7p+4q=9 \) & \( 7p-4q=9 \)
\end{array}

source_en:
To make green paint, you mix blue paint with yellow paint in the ratio \( 5: 3 \).
What should replace the star? \begin{tabular}{|c|c|c|}
\hline Blue & Yellow & Total \\
\hline \( \mathrm{1500 ml} \) & \( \bigstar \) 
\hline
\end{tabular}

translation:
