source_en:
A = {x \epsilon N : 1 \leq x < 7 and x is prime number}
 B = {3, 4, 5} and C = {x \epsilon N : 6 < x \leq 12 and x is even number}

 A \cap B = What?

translation:
A = {x \epsilon N: 1 \leq x <7 এবং x হল মৌলিক সংখ্যা}
B = {3,4,5} এবং C = {x \epsilon N: 6 <x \leq 12 এবং x হল জোড় সংখ্যা}

A \cap B = কি?

back_translation:
A = {x \epsilon\ 1: 1 \leq x < 7 and x is a prime number}
B = {3,4,5} and C = {x \epsilon\ 1: 6 < x \leq 12 and x is an even number}

A \cap B = কি?

